#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:139
msgctxt "Description tip for Affiliate landing pages setting"
msgid "Use the <code>Affiliate Landing Page</code> meta box on a single page, post, or product to assign it to an affiliate which they can promote without using an affiliate link. The commission will be calculated based on the commission plan."
